\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\title{Adjoints, curvature and finite inverses}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The covariant cochain differential raises exterior degree.
A coefficient pairing also compares its values with cochains
one degree lower. The resulting adjoint raises the questions
of how curvature affects the kernel and when a finite inverse
can recover a cochain from its first-order difference.}

